;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;This nomination was a surprise after Marvel cancelled its creative, quirky superhero series, &lt;em&gt;Wonder Man&lt;/em&gt;. But star &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/08/20/nx-s1-5937559/wonder-man-marvel-yahya-abdul-mateen-ii" target="_blank"&gt;Yahya Abdul-Mateen II is spellbinding&lt;/a&gt; as a superpowered guy who just wants to be a successful actor, blending comedy, pathos and drama. &lt;em&gt;— Eric Deggans &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;h3 class="edTag"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outstanding lead actress, comedy: Lisa Kudrow, &lt;em&gt;The Comeback   &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-142783" class="bucketwrap image large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 900;         --source-height: 506;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/900x506+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F93%2Faa%2Fceb8eeb046e2aa14cad5c94723fe%2Fimage-11.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/900x506+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F93%2Faa%2Fceb8eeb046e2aa14cad5c94723fe%2Fimage-11.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/900x506+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F93%2Faa%2Fceb8eeb046e2aa14cad5c94723fe%2Fimage-11.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/900x506+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F93%2Faa%2Fceb8eeb046e2aa14cad5c94723fe%2Fimage-11.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/900x506+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F93%2Faa%2Fceb8eeb046e2aa14cad5c94723fe%2Fimage-11.jpg 1200w