&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;The category's stacked, but &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/04/01/nx-s1-5766473/lisa-kudrow-returns-in-the-comeback-and-we-did-need-to-see-that" target="_blank"&gt;Lisa Kudrow's Valerie Cherish threads many needles beautifully&lt;/a&gt;: self-absorbed yet caring, oft-humiliated yet resilient, wacky but grounded when necessary. As a character in Season 3 says to her: "To me, you're it." Indeed. &lt;em&gt;— Aisha Harris  &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;h3 class="edTag"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outstanding supporting actress, comedy: Kate O'Flynn, &lt;em&gt;Widow's Bay  &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-142785" class="bucketwrap image large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 5398;         --source-height: 3035;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5398x3035+0+111/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Ffe%2F18%2F5b5b88074be297e12d674648b529%2Fwidows-bay-photo-010901.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5398x3035+0+111/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Ffe%2F18%2F5b5b88074be297e12d674648b529%2Fwidows-bay-photo-010901.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5398x3035+0+111/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Ffe%2F18%2F5b5b88074be297e12d674648b529%2Fwidows-bay-photo-010901.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5398x3035+0+111/resize/900/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Ffe%2F18%2F5b5b88074be297e12d674648b529%2Fwidows-bay-photo-010901.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5398x3035+0+111/resize/