(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1000x1185+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F0d%2Fd7%2F8ff3ee56461787f40071b672b832%2F010rajashehadeh.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1000x1185+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F0d%2Fd7%2F8ff3ee56461787f40071b672b832%2F010rajashehadeh.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1000x1185+0+0/resize/1000/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F0d%2Fd7%2F8ff3ee56461787f40071b672b832%2F010rajashehadeh.jpg 1000w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1000x1185+0+0/resize/1300/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F0d%2Fd7%2F8ff3ee56461787f40071b672b832%2F010rajashehadeh.jpg 1300w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1000x1185+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F0d%2Fd7%2F8ff3ee56461787f40071b672b832%2F010rajashehadeh.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1000x1185+0+0/resize/2000/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F0d%2Fd7%2F8ff3ee56461787f40071b672b832%2F010rajashehadeh.jpg 2000w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1000x1185+0+0/resize/2600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F0d%2Fd7%2F8ff3ee56461787f40071b672b832%2F010rajashehadeh.jpg 2600w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1000x1185+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F0d%2Fd7%2F8ff3ee56461787f40071b672b832%2F010rajashehadeh.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1300px) 1238px, (min-width: 1025px) calc(100vw - 60px), (min-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 60px), calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/jpeg" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1000x1185+0+0/resize/1100/quality/50/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F0d%2Fd7%2F8ff3ee56461787f40071b672b832%2F010rajashehadeh.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1000x1185+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F0d%2Fd7%2F8ff3ee56461787f40071b672b832%2F010rajashehadeh.jpg" class="img" alt="Raja Shehadeh" loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Raja Shehadeh&lt;br&gt;                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Mariana Cook                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;b class="toggle-caption"&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/b&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;I n the Nakba (the Arabic word for "catastrophe," commonly used to refer to the displacement and dispossession of Palestinians when Israel was established) in 1948, they destroyed so many of the journals and private papers of Palestinians, and they were never found again. And then in 1982 in Lebanon, in Beirut, they went to the Palestine Research Center and took all the papers and all the journals and everything there and destroyed it. And in 2002, in the re-invasion of Ramallah, they went into so many homes and destroyed the private papers and everything. And so I was worried that they would do the same for me.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;In 2023, with the Gaza war and the destruction of so much of the archives in Gaza, I became really worried and thought that I must do something to preserve these diaries. I kept the diaries in the garage. If the soldiers, as they did once, (would) enter my house, go to the garage and see them, they would just throw them all over the place and maybe set fire to them.&lt;/p&gt;       &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The two-year effort to move the archives from the West Bank to Scotland&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;I was very worried that the Israelis would stop it. So the first step was to digitize...page by page by page by page according to the highest standard with the cooperation of the University of Edinburgh University and Exeter University. And so three people worked day and night to digitize the diary … and all the documents that I had collected as well.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt; And the second step was to slowly start sending the documents out by ordinary mail without raising any attention to it.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shehadeh's 40-year quest to investigate the &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.nytimes.com/1985/12/03/world/moderate-palestinian-is-slain-in-west-bank.html" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;1985 killing of his father&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;, a prominent lawyer — and the Israeli police investigation files of the killing, which Shehadeh obtained in 2025&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-143029" class="bucketwrap image large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 2250;         --source-height: 3000;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa8%2Fff%2F2c2bbda1431c805b3f9aa134a572%2F005archivesample.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa8%2Fff%2F2c2bbda1431c805b3f9aa134a572%2F005archivesample.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/1000/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa8%2Fff%2F2c2bbda1431c805b3f9aa134a572%2F005archivesample.jpg 1000w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/1300/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa8%2Fff%2F2c2bbda1431c805b3f9aa134a572%2F005archivesample.jpg 1300w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa8%2Fff%2F2c2bbda1431c805b3f9aa134a572%2F005archivesample.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/2000/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa8%2Fff%2F2c2bbda1431c805b3f9aa134a572%2F005archivesample.jpg 2000w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/2600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa8%2Fff%2F2c2bbda1431c805b3f9aa134a572%2F005archivesample.jpg 2600w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa8%2Fff%2F2c2bbda1431c805b3f9aa134a572%2F005archivesample.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1300px) 1238px, (min-width: 1025px) calc(100vw - 60px), (min-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 60px), calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/