rightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/1100/quality/50/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa8%2Fff%2F2c2bbda1431c805b3f9aa134a572%2F005archivesample.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fa8%2Fff%2F2c2bbda1431c805b3f9aa134a572%2F005archivesample.jpg" class="img" alt="Handwritten letter dated January 10, 1949, sent to Aziz Shehadeh by the Akka- based business-owner Bahjat Eleassa from displacement in Lebanon." loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Handwritten letter dated January 10, 1949, sent to Aziz Shehadeh by the Akka- based business-owner Bahjat Eleassa from displacement in Lebanon.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Raja Shehadeh&lt;br&gt;                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;b class="toggle-caption"&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/b&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt; In the archive is the process by which I went about trying to get the police to investigate and the feelings that I had about it, which extended from '85 to 2025.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;It was clear that they had not investigated the main culprit, the man who had sent the letter to my father from prison threatening to kill him if he did not withdraw from a case of land that the family thought belonged to them or they were squatting on it. My suspicion, strong suspicion, is because this man was a collaborator, and he wanted to be protected, and Israel wanted to protect him as a collaborator.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;This is where it ended. We could not go beyond that.  &lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-143030" class="bucketwrap image large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 2250;         --source-height: 3000;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F29%2F15%2F6e06569c4f5b82323602e289ea03%2F004archivesample.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F29%2F15%2F6e06569c4f5b82323602e289ea03%2F004archivesample.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/1000/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F29%2F15%2F6e06569c4f5b82323602e289ea03%2F004archivesample.jpg 1000w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/1300/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F29%2F15%2F6e06569c4f5b82323602e289ea03%2F004archivesample.jpg 1300w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F29%2F15%2F6e06569c4f5b82323602e289ea03%2F004archivesample.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/2000/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F29%2F15%2F6e06569c4f5b82323602e289ea03%2F004archivesample.jpg 2000w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/2600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F29%2F15%2F6e06569c4f5b82323602e289ea03%2F004archivesample.jpg 2600w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F29%2F15%2F6e06569c4f5b82323602e289ea03%2F004archivesample.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1300px) 1238px, (min-width: 1025px) calc(100vw - 60px), (min-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 60px), calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F29%2F15%2F6e06569c4f5b82323602e289ea03%2F004archivesample.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F29%2F15%2F6e06569c4f5b82323602e289ea03%2F004archivesample.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/1000/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F29%2F15%2F6e06569c4f5b82323602e289ea03%2F004archivesample.jpg 1000w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/1300/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F29%2F15%2F6e06569c4f5b82323602e289ea03%2F004archivesample.jpg 1300w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F29%2F15%2F6e06569c4f5b82323602e289ea03%2F004archivesample.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/2000/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F29%2F15%2F6e06569c4f5b82323602e289ea03%2F004archivesample.jpg 2000w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/2600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F29%2F15%2F6e06569c4f5b82323602e289ea03%2F004archivesample.jpg 2600w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F29%2F15%2F6e06569c4f5b82323602e289ea03%2F004archivesample.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1300px) 1238px, (min-width: 1025px) calc(100vw - 60px), (min-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 60px), calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/jpeg" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/1100/quality/50/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F29%2F15%2F6e06569c4f5b82323602e289ea03%2F004archivesample.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F29%2F15%2F6e06569c4f5b82323602e289ea03%2F004archivesample.jpg" class="img" alt="Handwritten notes by Aziz Shehadeh of a meeting of the General Refugee Congress held in Ramallah on June 9, 1950, discussing the fate of refugees." loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Handwritten notes by Aziz Shehadeh of a meeting of the General Refugee Congress held in Ramallah on June 9, 1950, discussing the fate of refugees.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Raja Shehadeh&lt;br&gt;                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;b class="toggle-caption"&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/b&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;The Israeli police revealed all the investigation, but all the investigation was extraneous. It was distracting because the main suspect was not investigated, and that we have found out.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt; I had always suspected that it was this man who did it, and when I realized through this case that they have actually not investigated him, I felt that my suspicions were correct, and it gave me closure.&lt;/p&gt;       &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Shehadeh's diary entries documenting Israel's transformation of the West Bank over the years&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;I understood from early on that it was a matter of...staying put and persevering. Because I realized that what the Israelis wanted was to make life so difficult for the Palestinians in the occupied territories, to make them leave.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt; The only antidote to that is &lt;em&gt;sumud &lt;/em&gt;[Arabic for "steadfastness"]. Staying put and entrenching our existence by building institutions, by making work for people, by making it clear that we are here to stay. And I never changed my mind about this. I always realized that &lt;em&gt;sumud&lt;/em&gt; was the most important resistance to what Israel was trying to do.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Shehadeh hopes his legacy will be&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-143028" class="bucketwrap image large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 2250;         --source-height: 3000;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F30%2Fd0%2Fc621d9664ff598bc162e2bebc267%2F002archive-samplepoem.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F30%2Fd0%2Fc621d9664ff598bc162e2bebc267%2F002archive-samplepoem.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/1000/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F30%2Fd0%2Fc621d9664ff598bc162e2bebc267%2F002archive-samplepoem.jpg 1000w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/1300/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F30%2Fd0%2Fc621d9664ff598bc162e2bebc267%2F002archive-samplepoem.jpg 1300w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F30%2Fd0%2Fc621d9664ff598bc162e2bebc267%2F002archive-samplepoem.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/2000/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F30%2Fd0%2Fc621d9664ff598bc162e2bebc267%2F002archive-samplepoem.jpg 2000w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/2600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F30%2Fd0%2Fc621d9664ff598bc162e2bebc267%2F002archive-samplepoem.jpg 2600w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F30%2Fd0%2Fc621d9664ff598bc162e2bebc267%2F002archive-samplepoem.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1300px) 1238px, (min-width: 1025px) calc(100vw - 60px), (min-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 60px), calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F30%2Fd0%2Fc621d9664ff598bc162e2bebc267%2F002archive-samplepoem.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F30%2Fd0%2Fc621d9664ff598bc162e2bebc267%2F002archive-samplepoem.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/1000/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F30%2Fd0%2Fc621d9664ff598bc162e2bebc267%2F002archive-samplepoem.jpg 1000w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/1300/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F30%2Fd0%2Fc621d9664ff598bc162e2bebc267%2F002archive-samplepoem.jpg 1300w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F30%2Fd0%2Fc621d9664ff598bc162e2bebc267%2F002archive-samplepoem.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/2000/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F30%2Fd0%2Fc621d9664ff598bc162e2bebc267%2F002archive-samplepoem.jpg 2000w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/2600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F30%2Fd0%2Fc621d9664ff598bc162e2bebc267%2F002archive-samplepoem.jpg 2600w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F30%2Fd0%2Fc621d9664ff598bc162e2bebc267%2F002archive-samplepoem.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1300px) 1238px, (min-width: 1025px) calc(100vw - 60px), (min-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 60px), calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/jpeg" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/1100/quality/50/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F30%2Fd0%2Fc621d9664ff598bc162e2bebc267%2F002archive-samplepoem.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2250x3000+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F30%2Fd0%2Fc621d9664ff598bc162e2bebc267%2F002archive-samplepoem.jpg" class="img" alt="Palestine is Heaven, a poem written by Raja Shehadeh at the age of 18 in 1969 and published in the Jerusalem Post newspaper." loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Palestine is Heaven, a poem written by Raja Shehadeh at the age of 18 in 1969 and published in the Jerusalem Post newspaper.&lt;br&gt;                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Raja Shehadeh                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;b class="toggle-caption"&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/b&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt; I'm not so worried about legacy, but I'm concerned that, through the diaries, people will understand how things happened and the developments that things went through. That's very important for me, and this would be perhaps a greater way that I would have served human rights and truth than any other way, whether through my writing of books or articles or speeches. The diaries might bring about the results that I haven't been able to achieve in any other way. I think that is the important thing.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt;</description>
