      <title>Neighbor turned on neighbor after Charlie Kirk's killing. Is the divide here to stay?</title>
      <author>Odette Yousef</author>
      <link>https://www.npr.org/2026/09/12/nx-s1-5952234/charlie-kirk-death-doxing</link>
      <comments>https://text.npr.org/2026/09/12/nx-s1-5952234/charlie-kirk-death-doxing</comments>
